sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant User
  participant ReactApp
  participant API as API Service (Axios)
  participant Flask as Flask Backend
  participant Auth as Flask-Login
  participant LSTM as LSTM/ModelLogic
  participant CSV as CSV Files
  participant DB as MongoDB
  participant YF as Yahoo Finance

  User->>ReactApp: Login (username/password)
  ReactApp->>API: POST /api/login
  API->>Flask: /api/login
  Flask->>Auth: validate credentials (bcrypt, mongo)
  Auth-->>Flask: session established
  Flask-->>API: { user:{ id, username, is_admin } }
  API-->>ReactApp: store session/cookie

  User->>ReactApp: Make prediction (stock, duration, model)
  ReactApp->>API: POST /api/predict
  API->>Flask: /api/predict (login_required)
  Flask->>CSV: load {stock}_stock_data.csv
  CSV-->>Flask: DataFrame
  Flask->>LSTM: preprocess + predict(days_ahead)
  par optional current price
    Flask->>YF: fetch current price
    YF-->>Flask: price
  end
  LSTM-->>Flask: prediction payload
  Flask->>DB: save Prediction (user_id, stock, price, model, confidence)
  DB-->>Flask: ok
  Flask-->>API: prediction JSON
  API-->>ReactApp: render charts/results

  User->>ReactApp: View charts/history
  ReactApp->>API: GET /api/charts/<stock>, /api/history
  API->>Flask: fetch charts/history
  Flask->>DB: read predictions
  DB-->>Flask: predictions
  Flask-->>API: charts/history JSON
  API-->>ReactApp: display data



